officialText:
A request submitted under Section 3308.8 shall include:
1. Details of the modification or alternative system to be utilized;
2. Any stipulations;
3. Demonstration that the request meets or exceeds the level of safety afforded to the public and property by safety netting
systems and guardrail systems installed in accordance with this section;
4. Where applicable, a description of the practical difficulty of complying with code requirements;
5. Where applicable, a reference to the site safety monitoring program; and
6. Where an alternative system is proposed, a minimum level of inspection in accordance with the recommendations of the
manufacturer of the alternative system.

